      <ExpenseAmt>197415</ExpenseAmt>
      <Desc>Education The Clearity Foundation provides the latest information on ovarian cancer through multiple channels including the website, clinical trial finder, clinical trial resources, email newsletters, and blog. During the 12 months ended September 30, 2024, The Clearity Foundation developed and produced a three-part, online ovarian cancer education symposium for patients, caregivers, and other advocates. The three-part video series was offered at no cost to participants and featured ovarian cancer experts. Clearity also produced five content-specific webinars in 2024 to deliver patient-facing information on the most relevant ovarian cancer topics.</Desc>
      <ProgSrvcAccomActy2Grp>
        <ExpenseAmt>909396</ExpenseAmt>
        <Desc>Patient services The Clearity Foundation provides whole person support to women and caregivers impacted by ovarian cancer. For the 12 months ended September 30, 2024, Clearity supported women and caregivers with personally delivered one-on-one support, including nearly 1,500 hour-long ovarian cancer counseling sessions and 300 treatment education sessions. In addition, more than 3,400 personalized online clinical trial searches and more than 10,000 reviews of online information by clinical situation were conducted.</Desc>
      </ProgSrvcAccomActy2Grp>
